<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
<title><%= title %> · LinearPress</title>
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:#0f0f0f;color:#eee;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px}
  .rescue{max-width:460px;width:100%;background:#161616;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:10px;padding:32px}
  h1{font:400 28px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 6px}
  p{color:#bbb;line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}
  .error{background:#2a1212;border:1px solid #6b2424;color:#ffb4b4;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px}
  .notice{background:#122a18;border:1px solid #246b38;color:#b4ffc8;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px}
  form{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
  label{display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:13px;color:#aaa}
  input{background:#0f0f0f;border:1px solid #333;color:#eee;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px}
  button{background:#eee;color:#111;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
  button:hover{background:#fff}
  .links{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px}
  .links a{color:#88bbff;text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="rescue">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="margin:0 0 10px;color:#888;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em">DOMAIN RESCUE</p>
  <h1>域名急救</h1>
  <p>当自动配置关闭且主域名/备用域名填写错误时，站点可能无法从当前地址正常访问。请使用<strong>超级管理员密码</strong>验证身份后修复域名配置。</p>
  <% if (error) { %><p class="error"><%= error %></p><% } %>
  <form method="post" action="/rescue">
    <label>超级管理员密码（不会显示用户名）
      <input type="password" name="password" required autofocus autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="请输入超级管理员密码">
    </label>
    <button type="submit">验证并进入域名配置</button>
  </form>
  <div class="links"><a href="/login">返回登录页 →</a><a href="/">返回首页 →</a></div>
</main>
</body>
</html>